 ("Management of recurrent furunculosis (decolonisation)?", ["Nasal mupirocin twice daily × 5 days (monthly for some months), chlorhexidine 4% body washes, bleach baths, wash linen/towels hot, treat family carriers", "Long-term low-dose clindamycin 150 mg/day × 3 months, or rifampicin 600 mg/day × 10 days with another antistaphylococcal agent, or vitamin C (neutrophil function)"]),
