 ("Management?", ["Children: symptomatic (calamine, antihistamines, paracetamol — avoid aspirin); acyclovir 20 mg/kg four times daily × 5 days in adolescents/adults, secondary cases in households, chronic skin/lung disease", "Immunocompromised/pregnant/pneumonia: IV acyclovir 10 mg/kg 8-hourly", "Post-exposure: vaccine within 3–5 days, VZIG within 10 days for high-risk"]),
